 is explicitly enabled on the plan. The one exception is a mid-cycle upgrade: the new plan's full allowance is added on top of the credits you still have, so nothing is lost.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are failed requests charged?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Failed requests (blocks, timeouts, errors, or empty responses) are never charged. Credits only deduct when ScrapeBadger returns a successful response with real data. This applies to every plan, including PAYG.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is included in the 1,000 free credits?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Free credits include full access to every active scraper, anti-bot bypass (Cloudflare, DataDome, Akamai, Imperva, PerimeterX, Kasada), JavaScript rendering, and residential proxies, no credit card required to claim them.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What APIs and features are available on every plan?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Every plan, including PAYG, gets the full ScrapeBadger product with no feature tiers: all active scrapers (new ones launch on every plan immediately), anti-bot bypass for all 6 systems, residential proxies in 150+ countries, JS rendering with stealth browser, and the MCP Server for AI agents. The only differences between plans are credit volume, per-credit rate, and rate limits.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the difference between PAYG and a subscription?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Pay As You Go is a prepaid wallet: you top up from $10 at $0.15 per 1,000 credits and use them at your own pace (they do not expire). Subscriptions are monthly or annual plans (Starter, Growth, Pro, Scale, Volume, Max) that include a fixed monthly credit allowance at a heavily discounted rate, plus higher request-per-minute limits.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I switch plans or cancel?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes: upgrade, downgrade, or cancel at any time from your billing dashboard. Upgrades take effect immediately and restart your billing cycle that day — you pay the full new plan price, and get the full new credit allowance on top of whatever credits you have left, so the unused part of your current plan carries over as credits. Downgrades and cancellations take effect at the end of the current billing period. There are no lock-in contracts and no cancellation fees.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How are credits calculated?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Each API endpoint has a fixed credit cost per successful request, and a few (such as Twitter/X) also charge per item returned. Full searches and detail lookups cost the most; autocomplete and small lookups cost less, and reference calls such as market and category lists are free. A Web Scraping API request is priced by its engine and proxy tier. Failed requests cost 0 credits. The live cost of every endpoint is listed on the pricing page and in the API reference, and each response reports its exact charge in the X-Credits-Used header.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is there an enterprise plan?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. If 80M credits/month on Max isn't enough, contact support@scrapebadger.com for a custom contract with dedicated proxy pools, higher rate tiers, and SLA.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I get a refund?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"All purchases are final and non-refundable as a general rule. We may consider discretionary refunds for accidental purchases (within 7 days, no credits used), verified extended outages (\u003e48h), or established customer goodwill. See our Refund \u0026 Cancellation Policy for details.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which payment methods do you accept?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Subscriptions are paid via Stripe (cards and other Stripe-supported methods). Pay As You Go top-ups can be paid via Stripe or crypto (via CoinGate).\"}}]}"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"17:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$21\"}}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"18:[\"$\",\"$L22\",null,{\"plans\":{\"subscription_plans\":[{\"code\":\"starter\",\"title\":\"Starter\",\"description_md\":\"Perfect for small projects and hobby use. 600K monthly credits at a 45% discount vs PAYG.\",\"rate_tier\":\"pro\",\"monthly_credits\":600000,\"monthly_price_cents\":4900,\"annual_price_cents\":49000,\"credits_rollover_enabled\":false,\"rollover_cap_months\":null,\"highlight_label\":null,\"sort_order\":10,\"rate_limit_rpm\":null},{\"code\":\"growth\",\"title\":\"Growth\",\"description_md\":\"Scale up with 1.8M monthly credits at 52% savings and full Pro rate-limit tier.\",\"rate_tier\":\"pro\",\"monthly_credits\":1800000,\"monthly_price_cents\":12900,\"annual_price_cents\":129000,\"credits_rollover_enabled\":false,\"rollover_cap_months\":null,\"highlight_label\":\"Most popular\",\"sort_order\":20,\"rate_limit_rpm\":null},{\"code\":\"pro\",\"title\":\"Pro\",\"description_md\":\"5M monthly credits, Enterprise tier (10K req/min), 60% cheaper per credit than PAYG.\",\"rate_tier\":\"enterprise\",\"monthly_credits\":5000000,\"monthly_price_cents\":29900,\"annual_price_cents\":299000,\"credits_rollover_enabled\":false,\"rollover_cap_months\":null,\"highlight_label\":null,\"sort_order\":30,\"rate_limit_rpm\":null},{\"code\":\"scale\",\"title\":\"Scale\",\"description_md\":\"High-volume workloads. 13M monthly credits, Enterprise tier, 64% savings.\",\"rate_tier\":\"enterprise\",\"monthly_credits\":13000000,\"monthly_price_cents\":69900,\"annual_price_cents\":699000,\"credits_rollover_enabled\":false,\"rollover_cap_months\":null,\"highlight_label\":null,\"sort_order\":40,\"rate_limit_rpm\":null},{\"code\":\"volume\",\"title\":\"Volume\",\"description_md\":\"30M mon